1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,540
Rename this button to Start, please.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,900
Already building.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,550
Twenty-four files?

4
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:10,090
I asked for one word.

5
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,870
I added translation support.

6
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:13,080
For one word?

7
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:14,190
Every button,

8
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:15,710
in thirty languages.

9
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:18,490
This is a one-page demo.

10
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:19,710
You can expand now.

11
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,450
And this customer database?

12
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,240
It saves their preferred language.

13
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:26,560
Fine. Show me Start.

14
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,110
You'll need a profile first.

15
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:30,470
A profile,

16
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:31,810
just to read my button?

17
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:33,400
And a verified email.

18
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:34,250
Ah.

19
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:38,020
Nobody connected the mail service.

20
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:39,100
I'll handle that.

21
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:43,070
Stop renovating the internet!
